      "candidates": [
        {
          "entry_id": 2771,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.33537468,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What are your clinic hours and locations?\nAnswer: We are open Monday through Saturday from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM at 15a Willson St. The nearest free parking is a 3-minute walk away at the Mega Mall parking garage (9 Willson St.).",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2778,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.28160274,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never the reason for the call or any health details.\n\n## Messages we will never send\n\nWe will never ask for your card number, bank details, Social Security number or insurance member ID by text message or email. If you receive a message like that which claims to come from us, do not reply to it, and call the front desk on (212) 555-0142.\n\n## Changing your phone number or email address\n\nTell the front desk at check-in, or update the contact section of Form PR-1 at the self-check-in kiosk. Reminders are sent to the phone number we hold when the reminder goes out.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2766,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.24784787,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2765,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.23667759,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I bring to my first appointment?\nAnswer: Please bring a valid photo ID, your insurance card, and any relevant prior lab or test results related to your case.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2768,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.21681547,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2767,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.20169109,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Which health insurance plans do you accept?\nAnswer: We accept most major insurance providers, including Blue Cross Blue Shield, Aetna, Cigna, UnitedHealthcare, and Medicare. If you're unsure",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2772,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.19736695,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How early should I arrive before my scheduled appointment time?\nAnswer: If it is your first visit to our clinic, please arrive 15 minutes before your appointment time to complete your regist",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2770,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.195297,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: When is payment due, and what payment methods do you accept?\nAnswer: Payment is due at the time of service. We accept cash, major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express),",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2780,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.19358939,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "ltation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you start. Staff and other patients must not be recorded or photographed.\n\n## How long we keep records\n\nWe keep adult medical",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2764,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.17404717,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2781,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.16528106,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n\n## Annual physical examination\n\nAn annual physical is a preventive check-up for adults who feel well. It includes a review of your medical history and current medicines; y",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2769,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.16239709,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How much will my visit cost if I am paying out-of-pocket?\nAnswer: Out-of-pocket rates are $120 for a General Practitioner (GP) visit, $180 for a Dentist appointment, and $160 for all other s",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2773,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.15589543,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " is not in-network. AARP Medicare Advantage plans from UnitedHealthcare are in-network when the plan is a PPO, and not in-network when it is an HMO.\n\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medic",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2779,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.15071215,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " your last name and date of birth. The kiosk cannot take payments: any copay or self-pay amount is paid at the front desk.\n\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more t",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2777,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.15018818,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered M",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2775,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.1464275,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "have been asked to bring a urine sample, collect a sterile container from the front desk beforehand; household containers can contaminate the sample. Unless you were told otherwise, collect the first ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2780,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.14508513,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who ha",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2773,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.14480735,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "re not in-network with Blue Essentials HMO or Blue Advantage HMO plans, because those plans only cover care from their own medical groups.\n\n## Aetna\n\nWe are in-network with Aetna Choice POS II and Aet",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2779,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.14457124,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n\n## Registering as a new patient\n\nNew patients fill in three forms at their first visit:\n\n- Form PR-1, New Patient Registration: your contact details, emergency contact a",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2778,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.1414779,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n\n## Text message reminders\n\nWe send a reminder by text message 48 hours before your appointment and another 2 hours before it. Our messages always ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2773,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.13905248,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " visit at check-in. The front desk can estimate that amount for you if you give them your plan details before the visit.\n\n## Updating your insurance\n\nIf your insurance has changed since your last visi",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2773,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.13505025,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n\nThis guide lists, plan by plan, the health insurance plans we are in-network with. Insurance companies sell many plans under one brand name, and being in-network with a company",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2782,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.13042994,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " a back tooth - $210\n- D2140: silver (amalgam) filling on one surface - $160\n- D7140: simple tooth extraction - $240\n\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this l",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2774,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.12654193,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "d on the other side of your mouth for the first few days. For pain, use the over-the-counter painkiller the dentist recommended at your appointment.\n\nContact us if the bleeding has not stopped after f",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 2777,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.1256777,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": " room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.\n\n## If the clinic is running late\n\nSometimes an earlier appointment takes longer than planned. If your practitioner is running more than 20 minut",
          "text_truncated": true
        }
      ],
